                "svg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 520\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"دارة RL مع اتجاه التيار وأسهم التوترات\">\n  <rect width=\"1200\" height=\"520\" fill=\"white\"/>\n  <defs>\n    <marker id=\"arrow\" markerWidth=\"12\" markerHeight=\"12\" refX=\"10\" refY=\"6\" orient=\"auto\">\n      <path d=\"M0,0 L12,6 L0,12 z\" fill=\"#111827\"/>\n    </marker>\n  </defs>\n\n  <text x=\"600\" y=\"40\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111827\">دارة RL مع اتجاه التيار وأسهم التوترات</text>\n  <text x=\"600\" y=\"72\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#374151\">رسم نهائي واضح لتطبيق قانون جمع التوترات في دارة تحتوي على وشيعة.</text>\n\n  \n  <!-- main circuit -->\n  <circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"240\" r=\"48\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#111827\" stroke-width=\"4\"/>\n  <text x=\"180\" y=\"250\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#111827\">E</text>\n\n  <path d=\"M180 192 V130 H360\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#111827\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n  <rect x=\"360\" y=\"104\" width=\"170\" height=\"52\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#111827\" stroke-width=\"4\"/>\n  <text x=\"445\" y=\"138\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#111827\">R</text>\n\n  <path d=\"M530 130 H620\n           c 20 -40 40 -40 60 0\n           c 20 40 40 40 60 0\n           c 20 -40 40 -40 60 0\" \n        fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#111827\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n  <path d=\"M800 130 H920 V350 H180 V288\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#111827\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n  <text x=\"705\" y=\"82\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"27\" fill=\"#111827\">(L,r)</text>\n\n  <!-- arrows and labels -->\n  <line x1=\"265\" y1=\"88\" x2=\"875\" y2=\"88\" stroke=\"#111827\" stroke-width=\"3.2\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\"/>\n  <text x=\"570\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#111827\">i</text>\n\n  <line x1=\"390\" y1=\"228\" x2=\"505\" y2=\"228\" stroke=\"#111827\" stroke-width=\"3.2\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\"/>\n  <text x=\"448\" y=\"212\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#111827\">u_R</text>\n\n  <line x1=\"610\" y1=\"228\" x2=\"790\" y2=\"228\" stroke=\"#111827\" stroke-width=\"3.2\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\"/>\n  <text x=\"700\" y=\"212\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#111827\">u_b</text>\n\n  <line x1=\"118\" y1=\"340\" x2=\"118\" y2=\"148\" stroke=\"#111827\" stroke-width=\"3.2\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\"/>\n  <text x=\"86\" y=\"248\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#111827\">E</text>\n\n\n  <line x1=\"120\" y1=\"420\" x2=\"1080\" y2=\"420\" stroke=\"#E5E7EB\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <text x=\"600\" y=\"460\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans,Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#111827\">قانون جمع التوترات:  E = u_R + u_b</text>\n</svg>",
